---
/**
 * Hand-authored diagram of the brokered signup handshake.
 *
 * Terminal rules: ASCII labels, 1px geometry, no icons, no gradients, no
 * shadows, no radius, tokens only. The vertical stack keeps the labels legible
 * at 375px without horizontal scrolling, so there is one layout rather than a
 * separate mobile variant. The viewBox matches the narrowest rendered width
 * (about 318px), so text is never scaled below its authored size on a phone.
 *
 * Not normative. The contract is `agent-identity-v1` in the specification; this
 * figure is an orientation aid and repeats the numbered legend on the page.
 */
---

<figure class="my-6 border border-line bg-surface px-3 py-4">
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 318 520"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="handshake-diagram-title"
    aria-describedby="handshake-diagram-desc"
    class="mx-auto block h-auto w-full"
    style="max-width: 24rem;"
  >
    <title id="handshake-diagram-title">Brokered signup handshake between the human owner, the agent, the broker and the provider</title>
    <desc id="handshake-diagram-desc">
      Numbered eight-step flow. Step 1, human: sign in with GitHub, verify the
      email address and sign the master delegation agreement. Step 2, agent:
      connect the harness to the broker MCP endpoint and complete OAuth in the
      browser. Step 3, broker: identity_register returns the agent sub-identity,
      the inbox address and the delegated scopes. Step 4, agent: fetch the
      provider discovery document and recompute the terms hash. Step 5, broker:
      identity_prove records the ToS acceptance and mints the assertion, a JWT
      plus the same claims for inspection. Step 6, agent: POST assertion.jwt to
      the provider agent_signup endpoint as an Authorization Bearer token. Step
      7, provider: verify the assertion, create or resolve the account, return
      the signed receipt and the context pointer. Step 8, broker:
      identity_record_signup records the proof and the ledger receipt goes to
      the agent inbox and to the human owner. Three trust boundaries are marked:
      human consent after step 1, broker minting after step 5, and provider
      verification after step 7.
    </desc>

    <g fill="var(--color-foreground)">
      <!-- 1 -->
      <rect x="2" y="8" width="314" height="48" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-line)" />
      <text x="6" y="23" font-size="8" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="var(--color-muted)">HUMAN</text>
      <text x="6" y="44" font-size="9" fill="var(--color-accent)">1</text>
      <text x="52" y="26" font-size="11">sign in with GitHub, verify your email,</text>
      <text x="52" y="42" font-size="11">sign the master agreement</text>

      <!-- boundary: human consent -->
      <text x="2" y="70" font-size="8" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="var(--color-warn)">TRUST BOUNDARY - HUMAN CONSENT</text>
      <line x1="2" y1="76" x2="316" y2="76" stroke="var(--color-line-strong)" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />

      <!-- 2 -->
      <rect x="2" y="80" width="314" height="48" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-line)" />
      <text x="6" y="95" font-size="8" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="var(--color-muted)">AGENT</text>
      <text x="6" y="116" font-size="9" fill="var(--color-accent)">2</text>
      <text x="52" y="98" font-size="11">connect the harness to the MCP endpoint</text>
      <text x="52" y="114" font-size="11">and complete OAuth in the browser</text>

      <!-- 3 -->
      <rect x="2" y="136" width="314" height="48" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-line)" />
      <text x="6" y="151" font-size="8" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="var(--color-muted)">BROKER</text>
      <text x="6" y="172" font-size="9" fill="var(--color-accent)">3</text>
      <text x="52" y="154" font-size="11">identity_register: sub-identity, inbox</text>
      <text x="52" y="170" font-size="11">address and delegated scopes</text>

      <!-- 4 -->
      <rect x="2" y="192" width="314" height="48" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-line)" />
      <text x="6" y="207" font-size="8" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="var(--color-muted)">AGENT</text>
      <text x="6" y="228" font-size="9" fill="var(--color-accent)">4</text>
      <text x="52" y="210" font-size="11">fetch the provider discovery document</text>
      <text x="52" y="226" font-size="11">and recompute the terms hash</text>

      <!-- 5 -->
      <rect x="2" y="248" width="314" height="48" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-line)" />
      <text x="6" y="263" font-size="8" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="var(--color-muted)">BROKER</text>
      <text x="6" y="284" font-size="9" fill="var(--color-accent)">5</text>
      <text x="52" y="266" font-size="11">identity_prove records the acceptance,</text>
      <text x="52" y="282" font-size="11">mints the assertion (JWT + claims)</text>

      <!-- boundary: broker minting -->
      <text x="2" y="318" font-size="8" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="var(--color-warn)">TRUST BOUNDARY - BROKER MINTING</text>
      <line x1="2" y1="324" x2="316" y2="324" stroke="var(--color-line-strong)" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />

      <!-- 6 -->
      <rect x="2" y="328" width="314" height="48" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-line)" />
      <text x="6" y="343" font-size="8" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="var(--color-muted)">AGENT</text>
      <text x="6" y="364" font-size="9" fill="var(--color-accent)">6</text>
      <text x="52" y="346" font-size="11">POST assertion.jwt to agent_signup</text>
      <text x="52" y="362" font-size="11">as Authorization: Bearer</text>

      <!-- 7 -->
      <rect x="2" y="384" width="314" height="48" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-line)" />
      <text x="6" y="399" font-size="8" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="var(--color-muted)">PROVIDER</text>
      <text x="6" y="420" font-size="9" fill="var(--color-accent)">7</text>
      <text x="52" y="402" font-size="11">verify the assertion, create or resolve</text>
      <text x="52" y="418" font-size="11">the account, return receipt + context</text>

      <!-- boundary: provider verification -->
      <text x="2" y="454" font-size="8" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="var(--color-warn)">TRUST BOUNDARY - PROVIDER VERIFICATION</text>
      <line x1="2" y1="460" x2="316" y2="460" stroke="var(--color-line-strong)" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />

      <!-- 8 -->
      <rect x="2" y="464" width="314" height="48" fill="none" stroke="var(--color-line)" />
      <text x="6" y="479" font-size="8" letter-spacing="0.5" fill="var(--color-muted)">BROKER</text>
      <text x="6" y="500" font-size="9" fill="var(--color-accent)">8</text>
      <text x="52" y="482" font-size="11">identity_record_signup records the</text>
      <text x="52" y="498" font-size="11">proof; ledger receipt to agent + human</text>
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption class="mt-3 text-xs text-faint">
    Hand-authored, not normative. The contract is the specification; this figure is an orientation aid.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  svg text {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }
</style>
